* '''Right side''' — what creates ψ at this point:
** '''αF·F''' = ambient electromagnetic field-strength squared (proportional to E²−B²). EM stirs ψ directly.
** '''J<sub>ψ</sub>''' = the biological/intentional source — coherent neural firing, focused attention, tuned emitters.
